interconnected eco-systems and how plants and animals adapt to their changing environments over time.&nbsp; With these changes needing to accelerate in response to the climate crisis he asked his students to imagine how current species might mutate and adapt to cope with the future.&nbsp; The results are set out in two codices: Improbable Botany and Unlikely Animals.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-divider stk-block-divider stk-block stk-9b2098f is-style-bar\" data-block-id=\"9b2098f\"><style>.stk-9b2098f{border-radius:0px !important;overflow:hidden !important;box-shadow:none !important}.stk-9b2098f hr.stk-block-divider__hr{background:#00b0cc !important;border-radius:calc(2px \/ 2) !important;height:2px !important;width:100% !important}<\/style><hr class=\"stk-block-divider__hr\"\/><\/div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-5 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Springfield1.jpg\" data-lbwps-gid=\"3\" data-lbwps-width=\"1520\" data-lbwps-height=\"2100\" data-lbwps-srcsmall=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Springfield1-90x125.jpg\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"741\" height=\"1024\" data-id=\"3654\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Springfield1-741x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3654 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Springfield1-741x1024.jpg 741w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Springfield1-217x300.jpg 217w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Springfield1-768x1061.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Springfield1-1112x1536.jpg 1112w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Springfield1-1482x2048.jpg 1482w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Springfield1-145x200.jpg 145w, https:\/\/cc-ac