ploads\/2023\/07\/CCAC-Coppermill-Elementary-School-1B-Gallery-photos-by-Suzanne-Zhang-58-edit-4-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/CCAC-Coppermill-Elementary-School-1B-Gallery-photos-by-Suzanne-Zhang-58-edit-4-188x125.jpg 188w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/CCAC-Coppermill-Elementary-School-1B-Gallery-photos-by-Suzanne-Zhang-58-edit-4.jpg 1920w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/683;\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-extra-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><em>\u201cI\u2019ve learned a lot of sustainable materials \u2013 a lot of places we can get electricity. They\u2019ve actually been really fun too. It was a lot better than I was hoping it to be\u201d Student, Coppermill Primary School<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-extra-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><em>\u201cMy simple drawing became a really cool piece of art\u201d Student, Coppermill Primary School<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-extra-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><em>What has been fantastic working with the children here, is that they were actually way cleverer than I thought. They were really complicated concepts that I tried to teach them \u2013 like embedded carbon; operational carbon in buildings. They understood it. They are actually working with these concepts now\u201d Xavier de Kestelier, designer<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe title=\"CCAC - Coppermill Primary\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" data-cookieconsent=\"statistics, marketing\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/IAHnVr5qOxU?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe><div class=\"cookieconsent-optout-statistics cookieconsent-optout-marketing\">\t\t\tPlease accept <a href=\"javascript:Cookiebot.renew()\">statistics, marketing<\/a> cookies to watch this video.\t\t\t<\/div>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading title-bar has-black-color has-orange-background-color has-text-color has-background has-extra-large-font-size\" style=\"padding-top:5px;padding-right:50px;padding-bottom:5px;padding-left:50px\">Ordsall<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-columns stk-block-columns stk-block stk-30de43e\" data-block-id=\"30de43e\"><style>.stk-30de43e{padding-right:50px !important;padding-bottom:0px !important;padding-left:50px !important;margin-top:50px !important;margin-bottom:50px !important}@media screen and (max-width:1023px){.stk-30de43e{padding-right:0px !important;padding-left:0px !important}}@media screen and (max-width:767px){.stk-30de43e{margin-top:70px !important}}<\/style><div class=\"stk-row stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content stk-content-align stk-30de43e-column\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-8ca8f5d stk-block-background\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"8ca8f5d\"><style>.stk-8ca8f5d{background-color:#def0f5 !important;padding-top:50px !important}.stk-8ca8f5d:before{background-color:#def0f5 !important}<\/style><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-8ca8f5d-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-8ca8f5d-inner-blocks\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><u>Fashion futures<\/u><\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Interdisciplinary sustainable fashion designer Aurelie Fontan of Aurelie Fontan Studio worked with Year 5 students at Ordsall Primary School in Retford on a fashion-focused challenge.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">The children designed clothing for a speculative client set in 2050, imagining different climate scenarios \u2013 a desert, an ice-age, a waterworld.  German designer, Taskin, joined Aurelie to work up CGIs of the children&#8217;s concepts and another friend modelled another outfit.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-divider stk-block-divider stk-block stk-c05bf95 is-style-bar\" data-block-id=\"c05bf95\"><style>.stk-c05bf95{border-radius:0px !important;overflow:hidden !important;box-shadow:none !important}.stk-c05bf95 hr.stk-block-divider__hr{background:#00b0cc !important;border-radius:calc(2px \/ 2) !important;height:2px !important;width:100% !important}<\/style><hr class=\"stk-block-divider__hr\"\/><\/div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-6 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-4 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Ordsall1.jpg\" data-lbwps-gid=\"5\" data-lbwps-width=\"1920\" data-lbwps-height=\"1200\" data-lbwps-srcsmall=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Ordsall1-200x125.jpg\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"640\" data-id=\"3648\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Ordsall1-1024x640.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3648 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Ordsall1-1024x640.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Ordsall1-300x188.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Ordsall1-768x480.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Ordsall1-1536x960.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/upl